# Architecture.md
## Autonomous Treasury Rebalancer & Yield Sentinel (Testnet Phase)

This document is the single source of truth for the technical architecture. It is written so that a coding assistant can implement the system without ambiguity.

---

## 1. Technology Stack

| Layer | Technology | Purpose |
|-------|------------|---------|
| Frontend | Next.js 15 (App Router) | UI + protected API routes |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui | Component library |
| Wallet Connection | wagmi + RainbowKit (or ConnectKit) | SIWE login |
| Auth & Database | Supabase (PostgreSQL + Auth + RLS) | SIWE JWT, roles, audit logs, config |
| AI Reasoning | Google Gemini 2.5 Flash | Gas/slippage estimation, NL understanding, human-readable audit text |
| Execution Engine | KeeperHub (workflows + MCP) | Policy-constrained transaction execution |
| Wallet | Turnkey MPC (via KeeperHub) | Non-custodial signing – no private keys ever leave Turnkey |
| Blockchain | Base Sepolia & Ethereum Sepolia | Aave V3 Pool only |
| Agent Runtime | Node.js + TypeScript (standalone daemon or long-running process) | Polling loop, formula engine, guardrails, Gemini client, KeeperHub client |
| Package Manager | pnpm (recommended) or npm | Monorepo management |
| Smart Contracts | Foundry (optional local helpers) | Not required for core agent – we call existing Aave V3 |

