## 7. Audit Log Schema (exact payload)

Every cycle writes one row with this structure (see System Overview for full example):

```ts
{
  execution_id: string
  timestamp: ISO string
  trigger_type: 'SCHEDULED_CRON' | 'MANUAL_OPERATOR'
  organization_id: uuid
  actor_wallet?: string
  position_state: {
    protocol: 'AaveV3'
    network: 'Base Sepolia' | 'Ethereum Sepolia'
    target_wallet: string
    health_factor: number
    collateral_usd: number
    debt_usd: number
  }
  llm_reasoning?: {
    model: 'gemini-2.5-flash'
    thought_summary: string
    proposed_tool_call: string
  }
  guardrail_validation: {
    status: 'PASSED' | 'REJECTED'
    rules_checked: string[]
    violations: string[]
  }
  execution_details?: {
    keeperhub_workflow_id: string
    tx_hash?: string
    simulation_status: string
    gas_used?: string
    effective_gas_price_gwei?: string
    execution_status: 'CONFIRMED' | 'REVERTED' | 'GAS_EXCEEDED' | 'CIRCUIT_BREAKER_HALT' | ...
    retry_attempts: number
  }
}
```

Retention: 2 weeks (can be enforced with a scheduled Supabase function or external job).

